From 04bb061fa4b8b1f0e608b00d403a45ff36d98ef9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:09:22 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] loader: o menu entende boot_serial="NO"; o farol do tamanho
 do ASCII
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

O menu do loader mostrava "Dual (Serial primary)" com boot_serial="NO",
porque só conferia se a variável existia (o kernel já lia o valor). O
farol em PNG ocupa as mesmas 13 linhas do ASCII; o nome fica em texto.
---
 stand/images/Makefile           |   2 +-
 stand/images/lume-brand-rev.png | Bin 7138 -> 0 bytes
 stand/lua/core.lua              |  19 +++++++++++++------
 stand/lua/gfx-lume.lua          |   7 ++-----
 4 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 stand/images/lume-brand-rev.png

diff --git a/stand/images/Makefile b/stand/images/Makefile
index a39958d33..51dd2dcb0 100644
--- a/stand/images/Makefile
+++ b/stand/images/Makefile
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 .include <bsd.init.mk>
 
 FILES+=	freebsd-brand-rev.png freebsd-brand.png freebsd-install-brand-rev.png \
-	freebsd-logo-rev.png lume-brand-rev.png lume-logo-rev.png
+	freebsd-logo-rev.png lume-logo-rev.png
 
 FILESDIR=  /boot/images
 
diff --git a/stand/images/lume-brand-rev.png b/stand/images/lume-brand-rev.png
deleted file mode 100644
index e3080018b82ec1fab4cdb5618bd9e7b2e716b584..0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
GIT binary patch
literal 0
